      "writtenOn": "2024-06-07T08:50:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That is why I want to change the timeout for ChromeOS, but leaving the default to 1s. We can decide the next step after observing the crash rate with the new timeout.\n\nWe have a lot of these crashes and none of them are helpful, probably waiting and doing nothing won\u0027t change anything as well, might as well try something like changing the timeout to probe the situation.",
